<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Glenealy year net down 22 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Glenealy year net down 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	41.4     vs	 53.1</p>
<p>    Net profit		  46.6     vs	 59.9</p>
<p>    Turnover		   312.5     vs	227.9</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    68.9     vs	 85.5</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    8.7     vs	 53.5</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)    10.0     vs	 10.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Glenealy Plantations (Malaya) Bhd.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
